  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;be a quadrilateral. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> are the mid points of the diagonals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math> respectively and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,</p><p>Now plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0068_4e3054ef6bfa.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 254px;\" /></p><p>Now let position vector of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> respectively</p><p>Now by midpoint formula,</p><p>Position vector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And Position vector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
